# Legibility Office Research Papers

## Purpose

This directory contains the core academic publications of the Legibility Office Institutional Operating System (IOS) research programme.

Each paper contributes to a broader research agenda focused on institutional capability, governance architecture, procurement, Digital Public Infrastructure, AI governance, and state competitiveness.

---

## Current Research Programme

### Published / Under Review

- Governance Inheritance
- Institutional Operating System

---

### In Development

- Procurement Capability
- Digital Public Infrastructure
- Institutional Memory
- Coordination Architecture
- AI Governance
- Institutional Physics
- Institutional Intelligence
- Civilization Intelligence

---

## Standard Paper Structure

Each paper contains:

- Abstract
- Manuscript
- Figures
- Tables
- References
- Supplementary Material
- Journal Submission Files

---

## Target Journals

- Government Information Quarterly
- Public Administration Review
- Public Management Review
- Information Polity
- Digital Government: Research and Practice
- Policy & Internet
- Journal of Public Administration Research and Theory

---

## Vision

To build the world's largest open research library on Institutional Operating Systems.
